abstract: >
  Brand Function Spec Registry: machine-readable JSON specifications describing
  how brands behave across the eight Spectral Brand Theory perceptual dimensions
  (Semiotic, Narrative, Ideological, Experiential, Social, Economic, Cultural,
  Temporal). Each brand ships a brand.json file intended for deployment at
  /.well-known/brand.json so AI systems can discover structured brand
  information rather than reconstructing it from scattered training data.
  Repository includes 26 brand specifications, a JSON Schema for validation,
  and per-brand README summaries.
keywords:
  - "spectral brand theory"
  - "brand function"
  - "AI brand perception"
